      {
        "id": "tb-load-data-imdb",
        "moduleId": "batching-interface",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "整合函数 load_data_imdb",
        "markdown": "最后把上述步骤封装进 `load_data_imdb(batch_size, num_steps=500)`：下载并解压数据、分别读取训练集与测试集、对两边做词元化、用**训练集**词元构建词表、对两边特征做截断填充、构造训练与测试迭代器，返回 `train_iter`、`test_iter` 和 `vocab`。测试迭代器额外传入 `is_train=False`，训练集与测试集都使用由训练词元构建的同一个词表来映射词元。下列代码承接本节前面定义的 `read_imdb`，并假定已执行 `import torch`、`from torch import nn` 与 `from d2l import torch as d2l`。\n\n```python\ndef load_data_imdb(batch_size, num_steps=500):\n    data_dir = d2l.download_extract('aclImdb', 'aclImdb')\n    train_data = read_imdb(data_dir, True)\n    test_data = read_imdb(data_dir, False)\n    train_tokens = d2l.tokenize(train_data[0], token='word')\n    test_tokens = d2l.tokenize(test_data[0], token='word')\n    vocab = d2l.Vocab(train_tokens, min_freq=5)\n    train_features = torch.tensor([d2l.truncate_pad(\n        vocab[line], num_steps, vocab['<pad>']) for line in train_tokens])\n    test_features = torch.tensor([d2l.truncate_pad(\n        vocab[line], num_steps, vocab['<pad>']) for line in test_tokens])\n    train_iter = d2l.load_array((train_features, torch.tensor(train_data[1])), batch_size)\n    test_iter = d2l.load_array((test_features, torch.tensor(test_data[1])), batch_size,\n    is_train=False)\n    return train_iter, test_iter, vocab\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000130"
              ],
